hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"76","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harmala bin Imran Abu Hafs at-Tujibi ne Abu Ushshana al-Ma'afiri se, unhon ne Uqba bin Amir se hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko kehte suna: jis ki teen betiyan hon, aur woh un par sabr kare aur apni haisiyat se unhein kapde pehnaye, woh us ke liye Jahannam se parda hongi."
"77","Fadl bin Dukain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fitr ne Shurahbil se hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Ibn Abbas ko suna, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne kaha: jis Musalman ki do betiyan badi hon, aur woh un ke saath achha sulook kare, woh use Jannat mein dakhil karayengi."
"78","Abun No'man ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Zaid ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad binul Munkadir ne mujhe bayan kiya keh Jabir bin Abdullah ne unhein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: jis ki teen betiyan hon, jinhein woh panah de, jin ki zarooraten poori kare aur un par rehem kare, us ke liye Jannat yaqeeni ho jati hai. Maujood logon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: aur do hon to, aye Allah ke Rasool? Unhon ne kaha: do hon to bhi."
"79","Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne mujhe bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abi Salih se, unhon ne Saeed bin Abdir Rahman bin Mukammil se, unhon ne Ayyub bin Bashir al-Muawi se, unhon ne Abu Saeed al-Khudri se keh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: jis ki teen betiyan ya teen behnen hon, aur woh un ke saath achha sulook kare, woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"80","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin Ali ne mujhe apne walid se bayan kiya keh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Suraqa bin Ju'shum se kaha: kya main tumhein sab se bade sadqe — ya sab se bade sadqon mein se ek — ke baare mein na bataun? Unhon ne kaha: zaroor, aye Allah ke Rasool! Unhon ne kaha: tumhari beti, jo tumhare paas laut aayi hai, jis ka tumhare siwa koi kamane wala nahin."
"81","Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne humein bataya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ne humein bataya, unhon ne kaha: maine apne walid ko suna, Suraqa bin Ju'shum se keh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: aye Suraqa! usi tarah."
"82","Haywa bin Shuraih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Baqiyya ne hum se bayan kiya, Bahir se, unhon ne Khalid se, unhon ne Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib se keh unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko kehte suna: tum apne aap ko jo khilate ho woh tumhare liye sadqa hai, tum apni aulad ko jo khilate ho woh tumhare liye sadqa hai, tum apni biwi ko jo khilate ho woh tumhare liye sadqa hai, aur tum apne khadim ko jo khilate ho woh tumhare liye sadqa hai."
"83","Abdullah bin Abi Shaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, unhon ne Usman binul Haris Abur Rawwa' se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se: ek aadmi un ke paas tha, us ki betiyan thin, aur us ne un ki maut ki tamanna ki. Ibn Umar naraaz hue aur kaha: kya tum unhein rizq dete ho?"
